<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('components/head') %>

<link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/vid.css">

<body class="min-h-screen p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
  <video id="background-video" autoplay muted loop playbackRate="0.5">
    <source src="/public/vids/bg.webm" type="video/webm">
    Your browser does not support the video tag.
  </video>

  <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl text-white font-bold mb-10 animate-glow tracking-wider"><%= gameTitle %></h1>

  <div id="slide-container" class="w-full max-w-7xl h-[70vh] mx-auto rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-y-auto backdrop-blur-sm bg-purple-bg/40 flex flex-col justify-center p-6 md:p-8 text-white text-center">
    <div id="slide-start" class="slide mx-auto w-full md:w-[90%] text-left">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-purple-light mb-6 text-center">Hello, welcome to!</h2>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-purple-hover mb-4 text-center">
        Welcome to a special edition of "Who am I?" with a unique twist: all characters are VTubers! Each player will have a turn to ask questions and figure out which VTuber they've been assigned. But beware, you only have two attempts to guess, so choose your questions wisely!
      </p>
      <br>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-purple-hover mb-4 text-center">
        This game is designed for you to have fun, laugh, and discover new VTubers. Any feedback or suggestions will be valuable to improve in the future. Enjoy it to the fullest, ask if you have doubts, and have a great time!
      </p>
      <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mt-8 text-center text-purple-light animate-pulse">
        LET'S PLAY! <span class="text-pink-400">&lt;3</span>
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div id="slide-end" class="slide hidden mx-auto w-full md:w-[90%]">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-purple-light mb-6 text-center">Game Rules</h2>
      <div class="text-center mx-auto max-w-6xl text-purple-hover space-y-4 text-sm md:text-xl">
        <p>On each turn, you can only ask one question to try to figure out who you are.</p>
        <p>It is not allowed to abuse "trick" questions that may break the game dynamics.</p>
        <p>You have a maximum of 2 attempts to correctly guess who you are.</p>
        <p>The first person to guess correctly gets 1 point, and the second gets 0.5 points.</p>
        <p>Do not cheat or look at the live stream to get clues.</p>
        <p>If you need more information, you can use Google or any other tool.</p>
        <p>If you prefer, you can write down your questions in a notepad to organize yourself better.</p>
        <p>When you think you know the answer, wait for your next turn to confirm it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Navigation Controls -->
    <div class="mt-8 flex gap-4 justify-center">
      <button id="prev-btn" class="px-6 py-2 bg-purple-light text-white font-bold rounded-lg shadow-md disabled:opacity-50 hover:bg-purple-hover transition-colors duration-300" disabled>Previous</button>
      <button id="next-btn" class="px-6 py-2 bg-purple-light text-white font-bold rounded-lg shadow-md hover:bg-purple-hover transition-colors duration-300">Next</button>
      <button id="vamos-btn" class="px-6 py-2 bg-pink-400 text-white font-bold rounded-lg shadow-md hidden hover:bg-pink-500 transition-colors duration-300">Let's go!</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="/public/js/index.js"></script>

  <%- include('components/scripts') %>
</body>

</html>